  "description": "Send system email from .NET with one configuration section and one call. Synchronous SendMail and asynchronous SendMailAsync, multiple recipients, CC, attachments, HTML bodies, and STARTTLS / implicit SSL handled for you. Built on MailKit, so port 465 (implicit SSL) and port 587 (STARTTLS) both work out of the box. Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0.",
